{n:1,c:'onpage',pr:'H',t:'Duplicate Meta Titles',p:'Identical title tags across several pages blurred each page\u2019s purpose for search engines.',f:'Wrote unique, keyword-focused titles (50\u201360 characters) for every page based on intent.',imp:['Improved keyword relevance','Reduced cannibalisation','Higher organic CTR'],tools:['Screaming Frog','Search Console','Ahrefs']},
